      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what are you talking about? Goblins? I'm not sure I follow the analogy. I'm just looking for the actual mechanical faults. Can you just give me the technical breakdown without the metaphors? I need to know if I should be looking at the valve body or specific solenoids.",
      "source": "evaluator"
